d Cathy, wed for longer than they can remember, lead a quiet but monotonous life in the mountains. When a bear bursts out in front of Michel’s car, accidentally killing two drug dealers and revealing a €2 million loot in the process, their life takes an unpredictable turn, especially when they decide to cover up the incident and keep the money! But their plan leads them to stumble upon an unexplained trail of dead bodies. More used to being honest than crooked, Michel and Cathy’s clumsy cover-up efforts soon put an interfering inspector hot on their trail.","tagline":"Wild is the right word."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Michel et Cathy, un couple usé par le temps et les difficultés financières, ne se parlent plus vraiment. Jusqu’au jour où Michel, pour éviter un ours sur la route, heurte une voiture et tue les deux occupants. 2 morts et 2 millions en billets usagés dans le coffre, forcément, ça donne envie de se reparler. Et surtout de se taire.","tagline":"Sauvage est le mot juste."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggzcuZ3H1F2SMweo9frHyko7La2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s7xmwFJQj99lICSGQkr8sQ7G9IA.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1210732,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggzcuZ3H1F2SMweo9frHyko7La2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ggzcuZ3H1F2SMweo9frHyko7La2.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggzcuZ3H1F2SMweo9frHyko7La2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ggzcuZ3H1F2SMweo9frHyko7La2.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u48SN5uWghq1ePdB0uVL3Wi2ds9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300